WEBVTT

01:54.990 --> 01:58.850
Well then! The Shuuhou Seiha Private Academy Women's Kendo Club

01:58.850 --> 02:02.980
will be praying for certain victory at the Women's High School Kendo Tournament!

02:03.570 --> 02:05.080
Hurray!

02:05.080 --> 02:06.820
Yeah!

02:08.700 --> 02:10.580
Paradise, paradise!

02:10.580 --> 02:13.110
A bath after working out is the best, isn't it?

02:13.610 --> 02:16.810
We're depending on your strength for the big prize!

02:17.170 --> 02:21.440
About that tournament... Can I drop out?

02:30.560 --> 02:34.920
Even today, my Master in Distress is kicking up a fuss for some reason.

02:34.920 --> 02:39.850
However, I, Maid Guy, who always looks over your day-to-day life, am with you! {Pat: Original - "is with you!" The subject is I, not Maid Guy.}

02:40.480 --> 02:44.400
Stars for the sky! Flowers for the earth! And for you, Maid Guy!

02:44.850 --> 02:49.020
As long as I am in this world, your future is rosy!

02:51.980 --> 02:55.630
Naeka's Sword, Kurayama Training Chapter

02:52.020 --> 02:55.630
Service Seven

02:56.140 --> 02:57.400
You guys are mean!

02:57.400 --> 02:59.190
Note: Supokon is a genre where the main character earnestly tries to overcome various difficulties in his or her chosen sport with guts and great effort. [I.E.: Hajime no Ippo]

02:57.400 --> 02:59.190
Shut up, you fake supokon woman!

02:59.190 --> 03:01.030
What the hell are you saying,

03:01.030 --> 03:05.500
when we're in the middle of a onsen tour and praying for victory at the tournament, you coward!

03:05.520 --> 03:06.370
But,

03:06.660 --> 03:10.580
the result of this tournament will decide our budget for next year!

03:10.580 --> 03:11.590
But, but...

03:11.800 --> 03:15.740
Don't be so selfish just because your boobs are so big, you self-centered girl!

03:15.740 --> 03:18.580
Jeez, they float so ostentatiously in the bathtub!
Don't flatter yourself!

03:18.580 --> 03:20.340
My boobs have nothing to do with this!

03:21.050 --> 03:24.520
How about sending some nutrients to your head, instead of just your boobs!

03:24.520 --> 03:26.130
Haven't you been told that before?

03:26.130 --> 03:29.120
Of course you can't pull out now, you idiot!

03:30.010 --> 03:33.930
But she...she took my chastity!

03:33.930 --> 03:36.360
If you want to say something, then say it in Japanese!

03:39.970 --> 03:42.880
We are the Fujiwara Naeka's boobs fan club!

03:43.430 --> 03:46.910
Just beyond this threshold are Fujiwara Naeka's bare boobs!

03:47.330 --> 03:49.690
Those boobs that are floating in the bathtub!

03:51.950 --> 03:53.030
Did you hear that?

03:53.030 --> 03:53.970
Yeah, I heard it!

03:54.640 --> 03:56.910
Fujiwara is pulling out of the tournament?

03:56.910 --> 03:58.680
What on earth happened...

03:59.380 --> 04:01.160
to our Fujiwara?!

04:02.400 --> 04:06.130
Well, I also want to go to the national finals.

04:06.130 --> 04:08.300
I want to try my best and win.

04:08.300 --> 04:08.930
So why?!

04:09.890 --> 04:14.000
However, the circumstances this time are a little different.

04:14.000 --> 04:14.920
She...

04:14.920 --> 04:15.650
"She"?

04:16.600 --> 04:18.440
That's right, "she".

04:22.400 --> 04:27.860
The scars of numerous bullet holes carved into her back from a bear hunter who mistakenly shot her!

04:28.430 --> 04:32.540
The restive bear of the northern prefectures...
Half human, half bear!

04:32.990 --> 04:36.010
Note: Musashibo (1155 - 1189) was a famous warrior monk who served Yoshitsune of the Minamoto Clan. Commonly depicted as a man with great strength, loyalty, and honor.

04:32.990 --> 04:36.010
People call her the Musashibo of the world of women's Kendo! {Musashibo?}

04:36.010 --> 04:39.140
TL note: Shugendou is an old Japanese religion which centers on an ascetic, mountain-dwelling lifestyle and incorporates teachings from Shinto, Buddhism, and other eastern philosophies.

04:36.010 --> 04:39.140
Shugendou High School, second year, Arayashiki Yoshie.

04:39.140 --> 04:41.740
Breaking her three-year silence, she...

04:41.740 --> 04:44.300
That monster is coming down from the mountain!

04:49.950 --> 04:51.390
Arayashiki?

04:51.390 --> 04:53.460
I've heard of that name.

04:53.460 --> 04:54.880
If I'm not mistaken, three years ago

04:54.880 --> 04:58.870
she disappeared from women's Kendo after a certain incident,

04:58.870 --> 05:00.910
in spite of being a national up-and-comer!

05:00.910 --> 05:03.520
Naeka, do you have some connection with Arayashiki?

05:05.510 --> 05:06.740
Why don't you tell us?

05:07.520 --> 05:11.360
I...will never forget it. Three years ago...

05:17.330 --> 05:18.540
Face each other!

05:21.820 --> 05:24.880
To think I would face such a weakling in the finals!

05:26.090 --> 05:28.140
The Nationals are mine!

05:28.360 --> 05:32.040
Referee, is this all right? It's a guy.

05:32.660 --> 05:34.520
Err, she's a woman.

05:34.610 --> 05:37.070
You're kidding! You were born as a woman?!

05:37.070 --> 05:40.820
Oh, I'm sorry! You look so manly!

05:42.640 --> 05:44.240
Shut up, you little girl!

05:49.190 --> 05:50.200
S-sorry!

05:55.070 --> 05:57.670
And so, unfortunately,

05:57.670 --> 06:02.440
the elastic of her panties was at its limit and got loose...

06:05.160 --> 06:06.730
She lost due to a violation

06:06.730 --> 06:11.490
and has resented me ever since.
She said she would get revenge!

06:12.410 --> 06:14.640
Damn you, Fujiwara Naeka!

06:14.640 --> 06:17.190
I will cleanse you of this resentment! {Pat: Original - "I will cleanse this resentment of you."}

06:17.190 --> 06:21.160
On top of beating you to a pulp,
I'm gonna rip off your hakama and panties,

06:21.160 --> 06:24.970
and throw you butt-naked into the spectators' seats!

06:24.970 --> 06:28.900
The next time we meet will be the last time you'll ever be considered a woman!

06:28.900 --> 06:30.570
No way! I don't want to go!

06:30.570 --> 06:34.460
You got what you deserved! Even if your opponent was a monster, what the hell were you doing, you idiot!

06:35.120 --> 06:37.660
Even so, even though it's just a high school Kendo tournament,

06:37.660 --> 06:43.570
there are rumors of tickets selling for hundreds of dollars in auctions on the Internet.

06:43.570 --> 06:48.180
Even at the local electronics store, the video cameras are flying out of the shop.

06:49.000 --> 06:51.530
I wonder why...why...?

06:52.520 --> 06:54.000
Why indeed.

06:54.870 --> 06:56.370
To see Fujiwara Naeka's

06:56.370 --> 06:58.120
bare boobs with these very eyes!

06:58.120 --> 06:59.950
We might never get a chance like this again!

07:00.370 --> 07:03.730
It's unfortunate that Fujiwara will lose to Arayashiki.

07:03.730 --> 07:06.060
She's evidently greatly disfavored.

07:06.060 --> 07:07.160
From the bottom of our hearts,

07:07.160 --> 07:09.660
we're counting on you, Arayashiki!

07:11.660 --> 07:16.160
Those beasts! Today for sure, I'll be saying prayers over their bodies!

07:17.260 --> 07:19.250
Oh Chief, let me pull out!

07:19.810 --> 07:21.750
Please, Chief!

07:24.910 --> 07:26.230
Chief!

07:26.510 --> 07:28.160
It'll be fine if you win.

07:28.160 --> 07:29.040
That's it!

07:29.040 --> 07:31.720
Yeah, it'll be fine if you just win!  Fight!

07:32.190 --> 07:34.340
Do your best to win against Arayashiki.

07:34.340 --> 07:35.730
If we win at the Prefectural Tournament,

07:36.160 --> 07:41.300
the school president said the training camp for the Nationals will be in Okinawa!

07:41.300 --> 07:42.480
Okinawa?!

07:42.730 --> 07:44.270
Okinawa?!

07:49.830 --> 07:50.680
Fight!

07:50.680 --> 07:52.040
Oh!

07:52.830 --> 07:54.180
That might be nice.

07:54.550 --> 07:56.010
Okinawa...?

08:00.860 --> 08:01.840
I wanna go!

08:01.840 --> 08:02.880
I wanna go!

08:02.880 --> 08:05.600
That's right! Let's all go to Okinawa!

08:05.600 --> 08:07.020
Yay!

08:07.020 --> 08:08.530
We're counting on you, Captain!

08:08.530 --> 08:10.640
All right! Hey, wait!

08:11.210 --> 08:12.370
But, I...

08:12.370 --> 08:13.930
You'll be fine!

08:13.930 --> 08:15.010
Eiko?

08:15.010 --> 08:17.280
It's not like I'll be stripped if you lose.

08:17.280 --> 08:19.140
It's not fine at all!

08:19.350 --> 08:21.950
Well then everyone, let's do our best at the Prefectural Tournament!

08:21.950 --> 08:24.250
Let's go to the training camp in Okinawa!

08:23.580 --> 08:24.360
Yay!

08:24.840 --> 08:26.410
What's with everyone being so selfish?!

08:26.410 --> 08:28.740
Hey! Don't run off, point-getter!

08:38.800 --> 08:41.370
TL note: Naeka makes a pun on <i>sentou</i>  which means both <i>bath house</i>  and <i>battle,</i> depending on the Kanji used.

08:38.800 --> 08:41.370
Huh? A battle in the bathhouse?

08:42.790 --> 08:45.710
Western soldiers with the flag of truth?

08:46.550 --> 08:47.800
Shinsengumi?

08:49.320 --> 08:51.140
Note: Hijikata Toshizo  was the deputy leader of Shinsengumi, a small and talented Japanese military leader who resisted the Meiji Restoration.

08:49.320 --> 08:51.140
Hijikata Toshizo...?!

08:51.140 --> 08:53.970
But, why in the bath house dressing room...?

08:55.260 --> 08:57.070
Huh? A dream?

08:57.610 --> 09:01.550
Indeed. What you're seeing now is a dream.

09:01.550 --> 09:04.000
Daydreaming Maid Guy Illusion!

09:05.680 --> 09:07.000
Kogarashi-san?

09:07.000 --> 09:09.480
However, this illusion is just a naturalization.

09:09.480 --> 09:12.820
The foundation of this illusion is inside your heart.

09:13.760 --> 09:18.750
The shape of a warrior boldly standing up and facing victory at a critical time,

09:19.210 --> 09:23.250
that's what you wanted to become when you chose this path.

09:23.570 --> 09:27.600
Will you betray that spirit from the beginning and run away, Master?

09:27.600 --> 09:30.790
Put your hand to your naked chest and think about it!

09:33.620 --> 09:36.490
It's...not like I want to run away...

09:37.040 --> 09:41.770
I know the important thing isn't winning or losing the game, it's...

09:41.990 --> 09:45.820
That's right! It's about doing it and not running away.

09:46.380 --> 09:48.980
What can I do in order to win?

09:50.080 --> 09:51.480
What should I do...?

09:53.010 --> 09:54.740
Naked chest?!

09:58.160 --> 09:59.870
Leave her alone.

10:02.940 --> 10:03.870
You are...?!

10:03.870 --> 10:05.040
Divine retribution!

10:05.370 --> 10:08.420
Beasts like you should just disappear from the face of the earth!

10:08.760 --> 10:10.500
My eyes! MY EYES!

10:16.770 --> 10:18.690
Was that a scream?

10:18.690 --> 10:21.020
Who knows. What nice water.

10:50.090 --> 10:51.340
This is...?

10:51.770 --> 10:54.190
Huh? My Kendo uniform?

10:54.190 --> 10:56.480
Good morning, Master!

10:56.480 --> 10:58.160
This is an abandoned mountain temple

10:58.160 --> 11:00.350
that is deep in the hills surrounding Kyoto.

11:01.770 --> 11:03.580
What are you doing, Master?!

11:02.890 --> 11:05.090
Listen! Just answer me three questions!

11:05.090 --> 11:09.000
What did you see? What did you do? ANY LAST WORDS?

11:09.000 --> 11:11.490
Please do not worry, Naeka-sama.

11:11.490 --> 11:12.400
Fubuki-san!

11:12.620 --> 11:17.000
Kogorashi-san brought you here in a bag.

11:17.000 --> 11:19.540
I was the one who changed you into your Kendo outfit.

11:19.540 --> 11:20.910
Really?

11:20.910 --> 11:25.710
In that time, I gave him a very, VERY good talking to.

11:28.550 --> 11:32.490
In reply to your earlier question, we are at Mt. Kuramayama, in Kyoto.

11:32.490 --> 11:33.430
Mt. Kuramayama?

11:34.280 --> 11:36.490
A mountain where the legendary Tengu live,

11:36.880 --> 11:40.680
Note: Kurou Yoshitsune, otherwise known as Minamoto no Yoshitsune, was a general of the Minamoto clan of Japan in the late Heian and early Kamakura period.

11:36.880 --> 11:40.680
and an old temple where Kurou Yoshitsune was said to train with his sword.

11:41.370 --> 11:45.800
Note: Benkei refers to Musashibou.

11:41.370 --> 11:45.800
On this ground, Yoshitsune studied fencing and went on to defeat Benkei.

11:46.330 --> 11:49.680
A miraculous blessing from Mother Nature!

11:49.680 --> 11:52.500
It doubles the effect of your training! No mistake!

11:57.540 --> 12:01.620
Come to think of it, it feels like some kind of strength is stirring...

12:01.620 --> 12:03.980
That is the power of Mother Nature!

12:03.980 --> 12:07.460
Just what I expected from a sacred mountain! Now I feel like I could defeat a bear!

12:07.460 --> 12:08.600
Let's try!

12:08.600 --> 12:09.460
A bear?!

12:14.740 --> 12:19.560
Don't try and attack a bear head-on with a bamboo sword, you berserk master!

12:19.560 --> 12:22.410
You didn't even push it back one step.
But, you have good spirit!

12:22.410 --> 12:26.580
Since you tried so hard, I'll give you one of these Maid badges!

12:26.580 --> 12:29.440
What are you doing, you idiot?!

12:29.440 --> 12:32.580
When you have acquired ten Maid Guy badges,

12:32.580 --> 12:34.830
your training will be complete!

12:34.830 --> 12:37.200
Listen to me when I'm talking to you!

12:44.110 --> 12:48.280
A waterfall... This really <i>is</i>  like training in the mountains!

12:48.280 --> 12:50.050
Whoa, it's a long way down!

12:51.140 --> 12:54.210
I've heard that back in an unknown time, master swordsmen would train with the waterfall by choice.

12:54.540 --> 12:56.640
A waterfall is the two-dollar shop of training.

12:56.640 --> 13:00.690
Practice sword swinging under the waterfall, and when your skill is higher, you can also dive into the waterfall's pool.

13:00.690 --> 13:01.840
Master?

13:04.340 --> 13:06.510
Maid Guy DIVE!

13:10.080 --> 13:15.470
I said to dive into the waterfall basin after your abilities have gotten better, you gun-jumping master!

13:15.470 --> 13:18.550
But, I approve of your courage.
Here's your second badge!

13:18.550 --> 13:20.890
She didn't dive in, she FELL in!

13:20.890 --> 13:22.370
Are you all right, Naeka-sama?

13:23.410 --> 13:25.120
As I thought, special training is a little...

13:25.860 --> 13:29.000
No, Fubuki-san. I'll do it.

13:29.450 --> 13:30.790
Naeka-sama!

13:31.030 --> 13:33.690
I...won't run.

13:33.690 --> 13:36.250
In order to win against that formidable enemy...

13:37.230 --> 13:40.000
I have to become stronger!

13:41.190 --> 13:42.410
Naeka-sama!

13:42.410 --> 13:46.070
Even if my enemy is a bear or a waterfall!

13:46.070 --> 13:48.110
Let's begin our Waterfall Basin Training!

13:49.390 --> 13:50.810
YOU IDIOT!

13:54.340 --> 13:56.670
I wonder where everyone went?

13:56.670 --> 14:00.700
Well, whatever. Which one shall I play today?

14:13.010 --> 14:17.910
Set your mind to it... To the path of trials!

14:17.910 --> 14:19.740
I'm a bit worried...

14:28.590 --> 14:34.950
One Week Later

14:51.360 --> 14:55.290
Well done! Falling Water Leaf Slash! You've come so far!

14:56.460 --> 14:58.980
Just as I expected from the master that I've trained!

14:59.520 --> 15:02.590
There's only one badge left. Now, the final test!

15:02.590 --> 15:04.260
Do it if you can!

15:04.540 --> 15:06.260
Whatever comes...

15:06.500 --> 15:07.800
Go with your heart!

15:08.380 --> 15:09.520
I...

15:12.810 --> 15:14.060
I see it!

15:15.310 --> 15:18.960
Text:  Waterfall Huge Log Slash

15:18.290 --> 15:19.070
Impressive!

15:23.410 --> 15:27.340
You saw right through the log! Very impressive, Master.

15:27.340 --> 15:31.920
I'm sure if you made your brain work a bit,
you'd know whether or not you can cut a log with a bamboo sword.

15:31.920 --> 15:34.790
However, out of respect for your daring to fight with conviction,

15:34.790 --> 15:37.380
this final Maid Guy badge is yours!

15:39.820 --> 15:40.810
Master?

15:40.810 --> 15:45.010
Your badges are so heavy that she can't float to the surface! How many kilograms are they?

15:45.010 --> 15:48.140
Why would you use something that can't be cut with a bamboo sword anyway?!

15:48.670 --> 15:52.080
I found the master in the water with Maid Guy Love!

15:52.080 --> 15:52.890
Where is she?

15:52.890 --> 15:54.570
Under your foot.

15:56.060 --> 15:57.860
Naeka-sama!!

16:02.850 --> 16:05.600
Well, we somehow made it in time.

16:05.600 --> 16:08.230
Now that Naeka-sama has gone through the training, tomorrow's Prefectural Tournament is...

16:08.750 --> 16:12.450
I, Maid Guy, pity her opponents in battle.

16:14.520 --> 16:19.710
The hurricane called Fujiwara Naeka will surely dominate tomorrow's tournament!

16:25.430 --> 16:29.760
Fujiwara Naeka, you will finally get a taste of all my resentment!

16:31.310 --> 16:33.970
I can't wait until tomorrow!

16:34.390 --> 16:36.600
Battery, okay! Tape, okay!

16:36.600 --> 16:38.400
At last, it's tomorrow!

16:40.110 --> 16:43.780
Okinawa... Training...

16:45.680 --> 16:47.410
I'm restless because of all those expectations.

16:47.630 --> 16:50.700
I did it! I completed the Event CG section!

16:56.830 --> 16:57.790
Match set!

16:58.140 --> 16:59.590
Winner! White, Fujiwara!

17:02.060 --> 17:06.760
Well, it's become quite serious in the finals of the women's High School Kendo Prefectural Tournament!

17:06.760 --> 17:12.060
Captain Fujiwara Naeka, second year at Shuuhou Seiha Private Academy, is as strong as a devil!

17:12.060 --> 17:15.820
Wow, commentator Nishinaka, she's so strong, isn't she?

17:15.820 --> 17:18.000
Y-yes. She'll probably come up against Arayashiki in the finals.

17:18.000 --> 17:20.320
Arayashiki possesses superhuman strength, however.

17:20.320 --> 17:22.520
The deciding match has become something worth waiting for, hasn't it?

17:22.970 --> 17:26.610
More excitement from the broadcasting seats...
And now, a commercial.

17:26.610 --> 17:28.030
Multiangle!

17:28.030 --> 17:29.280
Fully zoomed!

17:29.280 --> 17:30.700
Recording Fujiwara!

17:30.700 --> 17:32.600
Don't let her out of your sight!

17:33.530 --> 17:35.370
Why the hell are the TV stations here?!

17:35.370 --> 17:39.700
Do they really want to see the bare skin of a big-boobed  high school kendo girl that badly?

17:39.700 --> 17:42.480
What will you do? If you lose, it will be all over the Internet!

17:43.010 --> 17:45.750
Has everyone already bought her bathing suit for the Okinawa training camp?

17:46.310 --> 17:49.430
Frankly, I think I might be at the peak of my life.

17:49.430 --> 17:50.570
I have no enemies!

17:50.570 --> 17:53.100
Naeka, you're different today!

17:53.100 --> 17:54.430
Okinawa is within our sight!

17:56.690 --> 18:00.510
Fujiwara Naeka. Your skill with a sword is formidable.

18:01.000 --> 18:05.030
However! This body has been forged with secluded training in the mountains!

18:05.380 --> 18:08.050
On top of that, with this special pit viper drink from central europe,

18:08.050 --> 18:10.500
I'll have three times my normal strength!

18:14.100 --> 18:18.790
The results of secluded training! The effects of the pit viper! I will show you all the fury of the viper!

18:19.400 --> 18:27.010
You will expose yourself to the ridicule of the entire country, Fujiwara Naeka!

18:29.520 --> 18:32.340
Final Match! Both competitors, come forward!

18:37.960 --> 18:39.100
Senpai!

18:45.660 --> 18:47.270
What's up with that wicked monster?

18:47.270 --> 18:49.370
I'm so glad I'm not in the finals!

18:49.370 --> 18:52.590
Who cares if your opponent is a monster?! Fight, Naeka!

18:54.910 --> 18:59.440
Just what you'd expect from three years of secluded training in the mountains!

18:59.440 --> 19:01.830
She's three times bigger than the last time!

19:01.830 --> 19:03.670
No...! Five times!

19:03.980 --> 19:08.000
Fujiwara Naeka, I've been waiting for this day!

19:12.040 --> 19:13.630
Synthetic fiber! Caramel!

19:14.200 --> 19:15.710
Calm down, Master.

19:15.710 --> 19:17.610
Your opponent is twice the size of a bear at best.

19:17.610 --> 19:19.780
She's not really your opponent!

19:20.240 --> 19:23.520
That's right. Calm down, Fujiwara Naeka!

19:23.520 --> 19:25.990
Remember the difficult training!

19:34.420 --> 19:36.160
I have no idea what's going on, but...

19:36.160 --> 19:37.570
What amazing spirit.

19:43.090 --> 19:43.910
Begin!

19:44.760 --> 19:46.420
I'm gonna punish you!

19:48.120 --> 19:50.550
She's fast! But even I...!

20:01.040 --> 20:04.820
This is hard, but compared to getting those ten badges, it's easy!

20:07.700 --> 20:09.590
I'm gonna finish this now.

20:16.610 --> 20:17.290
Her eyes?

20:19.800 --> 20:20.660
Senpai!

20:20.660 --> 20:21.580
Naeka!

20:23.150 --> 20:24.000
I see it!

20:25.010 --> 20:25.830
What?!

20:35.440 --> 20:37.210
W-white! Torso hit! One point!

20:37.470 --> 20:38.970
She did it!

20:37.800 --> 20:38.970
She won!

20:46.260 --> 20:48.820
Bravo! You showed me the Monster Slash!

20:49.620 --> 20:52.580
If you remain serious with such a trifle thing now,
victory will follow.

20:52.580 --> 20:56.820
But, hurry up and figure out you're carrying a bamboo sword, Master!

20:57.110 --> 20:58.790
Hey, stay with us!

20:59.160 --> 21:01.190
That meant nothing! Get ready!

21:01.190 --> 21:02.830
Get ready!!!

21:06.440 --> 21:08.860
I'm sorry, but I can't allow you to lay a hand on my master.

